Z||000000||88/2.8||03-22-2001||10:49 AM||||Oreif, Ogre, Somebody, Can anyone give me some specs. on an 88 formula? like 0-60, 1/4 mile, dry weight, stopping distances, and other stuff???||||reg||6
Z||000001||Oreif||03-22-2001||11:29 AM||||These are the spec's listed by Car and Driver in 1988.<BR>Weight = 2679<BR>Stopping distance = 147 feet<BR>0-30 = 2.2 seconds<BR>0-60 = 7.2 seconds<BR>1/4 mile = 15.4 @ 96mph<P>Vehicle was an 88 Formula with the 5-spd.<BR>Speed times would be slower with an automatic.<P>What else do you want to know?||||reg||1
